    "message": "Preview interventions on the shared generated Scenario\n\nTwo Project tests ran a Scenario they built with InitialScenarioBuilder\n(10 evacuees, one day, seed 7) before asking for an intervention\npreview. They now use the shared generated_scenario fixture (#88) and\nmove to tests/integration/test_project_intervention_preview.py with a\nsmall fake provider of their own, as the other LLM test files have.\nThe compiler's unit tests stay in tests/unit/llm/test_natural_language.py.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
